    "message": "feat(context): expose ix_context over MCP and support JSON export\n\nAdd the ix_context MCP tool with bounded budget parameters\n(--max-entities/--max-relationships/--max-evidence) and optional\nhistorical --as-of-rev, wired through the same argv isolation and\njson formatting as the other JSON-backed tools. The context command\nalso gains --out <path> to write the bundle to a file, so evidence\nbundles can be exported for review or storage.\n\nThe MCP catalog now lists ix_context for OSS installs; Pro-only\ntool gating is unchanged.",
